 output tokens (based on the median across providers serving the model). For a blended rate (7:2:1 cache hit/input/output ratio), this is $0.38 per 1M tokens. Pricing may vary by provider.","$L5a"]}]}]]}],"$L5b","$L5c","$L5d","$L5e","$L5f","$L60","$L61","$L62","$L63","$L64","$L65","$L66","$L67"]}],"$L68"]]}]
