93:T144a,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"When was GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) released?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) was released on August 11, 2025."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who created GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) was created by Z AI."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How intelligent is GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) scores 7 (estimated) on the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index, placing it below average among other open weight non-reasoning models of similar size (median: 7)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How fast is GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) generates output at 46.3 tokens per second (based on the median across providers serving the model), which is below average compared to other open weight non-reasoning models of similar size (median: 64.3 t/s)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the latency of GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) has a time to first token (TTFT) of 2.76s (based on the median across providers serving the model), which is at the higher end compared to other open weight non-reasoning models of similar size (median: 1.86s)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) costs $0.60 per 1M input tokens (somewhat higher than average, median: $0.49) and $1.80 per 1M output tokens (somewhat higher than average, median: $0.81), based on the median across providers serving the model."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) API pricing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) costs $0.60 per 1M input tokens and $1.80 per 1M output tokens (based on the median across providers serving the model). For a blended rate (7:2:1 cache hit/input/output ratio), this is $0.38 per 1M tokens. Pricing may vary by provider."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) a reasoning model?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No, GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) is not a reasoning model. It provides direct responses without extended chain-of-thought reasoning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What input modalities does GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) support?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) supports text and image input."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What output modalities does GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) support?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) supports text output."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) process images?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) supports image input and can analyze, describe, and answer questions about images."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) multimodal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) is multimodal. It can process text and image input and generate text output."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the context window of GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) has a context window of 64k tokens. This determines how much text and conversation history the model can process in a single request."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) open source?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) is open weights. The model weights are publicly available and can be downloaded for self-hosting."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many parameters does GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) has 108 billion parameters (12 billion active)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the active parameters of GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) is a Mixture of Experts (MoE) model with 108 billion total parameters, but only 12 billion active parameters are used during inference."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the license for GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) is released under the MIT license. This license allows commercial use."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) perform on benchmarks?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) achieves a score of 7 on the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index. This composite benchmark evaluates models across reasoning, knowledge, mathematics, and coding."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) available via API?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) is available via API through 1 provider."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where can I use GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GLM-4.5V (Non-reasoning) is available through 1 API provider."}}]}68:["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$93"}}]
